  "displayName": "Sky Q S6.2 USB Bridge",
  "description": "Homebridge plugin that polls Sky Q boxes for now-playing data and forwards it to a Systemline S6.2 multi-room audio system via USB-to-RS232 serial cables. Reconstructs the Sky Gnome RS232 protocol so the S6.2 touch screen displays channel and programme information.",
